## F4 — Map buildings grow/shrink per reference

Reference: KF10 (`00:52.35`, S08 Map Table) + S08 text: KILCAIRN parchment map
with wooden 3D `ELWAY MANOR` / `CONSTABLES' GUILDHALL` tokens, selected token
highlighted, `[F] ENTER MATCH` reticle. Prior state (draft F4): Den minis at
fixed scale 0.24 with highlight-only response; 2D tactical map had no grow logic.

### UE-derived values (cooked, verified on disk 2026-11-20)
- `extracted/json/Art/UI/Map/SM_MapBuilding_OldManor.json` — StaticMesh
  ExtendedBounds SphereRadius **45.56192**, BoxExtent (36.6074, 25.39115, 20.92738).
- `extracted/json/Art/UI/Map/SM_MapBuilding_GuildHall.json` — StaticMesh
  ExtendedBounds SphereRadius **27.39531**, BoxExtent (20.48586, 14.78825, 13.43562).
- Ratio OldManor/GuildHall = 45.56192/27.39531 ≈ 1.6631 (python3 float division).

