## F10 — Diamond tool light sane, never blinding

Reference: KF21 (02:32.20 RED guard silhouette in diamond scan), KF22 (02:33.00
GREEN transition), KF09 (Den table diamond). Prior state (draft F10):
emissive + bloom with no FP light node; gem at 1.25.

### UE-derived values (cooked, verified on disk 2026-11-20)
- `extracted/json/Art/Gameplay/Gear/VistaraDiamond/MI_VistaraDiamond.json` —
  `MaterialInstanceConstant/MI_VistaraDiamond`: StaticSwitch `Emissive On?` =
  **false**, `Emissive` TextureParameterValue = **null**. UE authors the
  diamond brass with emissive OFF.
- `extracted/json/Gameplay/Tools/PrimaryTools/VistaraDiamond/BP_VistaraDiamond_Tool.json`
  — `BlueprintGeneratedClass/BP_VistaraDiamond_Tool_C` (2 exports).
- `extracted/json/Art/Gameplay/Gear/VistaraDiamond/SK_VistaraDiamond.json` — present.

